# It names the same release as the Qyl.Telemetry.SemanticConventions PackageVersion in
# Directory.Packages.props (with the v prefix); ./eng/build.sh Contracts (doc pins) holds the two
# together. ./eng/build.sh LiveCheck clones the registry at this tag into .semconv and runs weaver.
